{"2547010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mik", "steam_appid": 2547010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/59c30d425cfe8522fa295fd990a99328.poster.avif?t=1787863657\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/59c30d425cfe8522fa295fd990a99328.webm?t=1787863657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up after an untold amount of time, you find yourself in the decaying remains of a vast, lifeless facility. Set in a <strong><i>Blame!</i>-esque</strong> world, you must navigate the depths of an <strong>abandoned megastructure</strong>—a seemingly endless structure of ruins and corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through chained <strong>parkour </strong>movement, you traverse the crumbling infrastructure, exploring a desolate world long forgotten. But there is no one left to witness it but the massive iron structure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/0e9b5229afb0760d925859f87d957f71.avif?t=1787863657\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore &amp; traverse the vastness of the <strong>Megastructure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through spaces as small as ventilation shafts to giant rooms of which you cant even see the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the past and piece together the mysterious <strong>lore</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine classic <strong>parkour</strong> with <strong>environmental puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, Wallrun and Dash through the game...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... or take it slow and enjoy the view </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/59c30d425cfe8522fa295fd990a99328.poster.avif?t=1787863657\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/59c30d425cfe8522fa295fd990a99328.webm?t=1787863657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up after an untold amount of time, you find yourself in the decaying remains of a vast, lifeless facility. Set in a <strong><i>Blame!</i>-esque</strong> world, you must navigate the depths of an <strong>abandoned megastructure</strong>—a seemingly endless structure of ruins and corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through chained <strong>parkour </strong>movement, you traverse the crumbling infrastructure, exploring a desolate world long forgotten. But there is no one left to witness it but the massive iron structure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/0e9b5229afb0760d925859f87d957f71.avif?t=1787863657\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore &amp; traverse the vastness of the <strong>Megastructure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through spaces as small as ventilation shafts to giant rooms of which you cant even see the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the past and piece together the mysterious <strong>lore</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine classic <strong>parkour</strong> with <strong>environmental puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, Wallrun and Dash through the game...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... or take it slow and enjoy the view </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Mik is an atmospheric, narrative-driven platformer, set in a post-apocalyptic world. What was once a thriving megastructure is now a rotting corpse of a facility, where you find yourself exploring fragments of the past.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/6f58070e5602e9b2a5a1dca820ad4ba147aa4bfd/header.jpg?t=1787863657", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/f7279c90461ea139d507a296c16bab25a8eb25e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787863657", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/f7279c90461ea139d507a296c16bab25a8eb25e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787863657", "website": "https://stefaaan06.com/games/mik", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-6600k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requirements may be subject to change as development continues.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Proc